					Comment for Type of Reporting Person:
				</div><div class="largetext" style="text-align:justify">(1)    The percentage set forth in row (13) is based on 34,639,445 shares outstanding on August 1, 2026, as reported on the Form 10-Q for the Registrant filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on August 13, 2026.</div></div></div><div class="form1"><table><tr><td class="center"><br><br><p><div align="center" style="font-size:1.2em;">
